@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Effective Date: 22nd February 2025 </p>

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>
    Welcome to <strong>Rooted</strong>, a mood-based task management application designed to enhance productivity through personalised task recommendations, gamification, and sustainability incentives. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal data when you use the Rooted application.
</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<h3>a. Personal Information</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Username and Email Address: Collected during account creation to provide access to the app and for authentication purposes.</li>
</ul>

<h3>b. Usage Data</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Task Information: Tasks you create, complete, or delete within the app.</li>
    <li>Mood and Energy Levels: Information provided by you to tailor task recommendations.</li>
    <li>Rewards and Achievements: Data related to gamification elements, such as points, streaks, and badges.</li>
</ul>

<h3>c. Technical Data</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Device Information: Type of device used, operating system, and browser type (if applicable).</li>
    <li>IP Address: Automatically collected for security and troubleshooting purposes.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Provide and maintain the Rooted application.</li>
    <li>Personalise your experience by tailoring task recommendations to your mood and energy levels.</li>
    <li>Track your progress, achievements, and rewards.</li>
    <li>Improve our app based on usage analytics and feedback.</li>
    <li>Ensure the security of your account and data.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
<p>
    Your data is stored securely using <strong>SQL databases</strong> and is protected against unauthorised access or disclosure. We use industry-standard encryption and authentication protocols to safeguard your information.
</p>

<h2>5. Sharing Your Information</h2>
<p>
    We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to outside parties. Your data will only be shared:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>With <strong>third-party tree-planting APIs</strong> (e.g., Tree-Nation or One Tree Planted) if you choose to plant a tree as part of the app's reward system. Only the relevant data required for this functionality will be shared.</li>
    <li>When required by law or to protect the rights, property, or safety of Rooted users.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Access</strong> the personal data we hold about you.</li>
    <li><strong>Update or delete</strong> your personal data at any time.</li>
    <li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> for us to process your data where applicable.</li>
</ul>
<p>
    To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at: <strong>legal@rootedapp.com</strong>
</p>

<h2>7. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with the updated date. Continued use of the app after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
</p>

<h2>8. Contact Information</h2>
<p>
    If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, please contact us at:<br>
    <strong>Email:</strong> support@rootedapp.com<br>
    <strong>Address:</strong> 64 Zoo Lane
</p>
